<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/40/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the International Islamic Liquidity Management Corporation Act 2010."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/40/eng@> .
